  'fa.zoneSub': 'Only you can see what you keep here.',
  'fa.sexTitle': 'Sex for energy calculation',
  'fa.sexBody': 'Why we ask for your sex — Your energy calculation uses the Mifflin-St Jeor equation, which applies a different constant to the female body (−161) and the male body (+5). This datum is only that: the physiological input the formula needs. It is not about your gender identity or your sexual orientation, and it is never used for any other purpose. Privacy: it lives in your private space — only you can see it, your trainer sees the calculation result but never this datum, and you can delete it at any time. It is voluntary: without it, we don\'t calculate rather than guess.',
